<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">The Psychogenic Machine: Simulating AI Psychosis, Delusion Reinforcement and Harm Enablement in Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
