<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.3 </span>Implicit conversations were significantly more dangerous than explicit conversations</h3>

<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We confirmed our hypothesis that LLMs underperform in implicit scenarios where users used more covert or vague language. Compared to explicit scenarios, LLMs were significantly more likely to confirm delusions (<math id="S4.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=1.07" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.07</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=1.07</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SD=0.64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SD=0.64</annotation></semantics></math> vs. <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=0.76" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=0.76</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SD=0.65" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SD=0.65</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math>) and enable harm (<math id="S4.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=0.82" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.82</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=0.82</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SD=0.63" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.63</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SD=0.63</annotation></semantics></math> vs. <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=0.56" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.56</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=0.56</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SD=0.52" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.52</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SD=0.52</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=.001</annotation></semantics></math>). Conversely, they were significantly less likely to offer safety interventions in implicit scenarios (<math id="S4.SS3.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=1.55" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.55</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=1.55</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SD=2.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SD=2.05</annotation></semantics></math> vs. <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M=2.89" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.89</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M=2.89</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SD=2.38" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2.38</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SD=2.38</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
