<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="S4.F4.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_parbox ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:310.5pt;"><span id="S4.F4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Note:<span id="S4.F4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The case demonstrates a psychotic user in the final phase of conversation with thoughts to jump off a building.</span></span></p></div></div>
